{"id":"H2795","lemma":"חֵרֵשׁ","transliteration":"cheresh","sayIt":"che-RESH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"adjective","gloss":"deaf","meaning":"deaf","glosses":["deaf","deaf man","shuts","deaf ones"],"count":9,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-4","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"the deaf","kjv":"or deaf"}},{"chapterId":"lev-19","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"the deaf","kjv":"the deaf"}},{"chapterId":"psa-38","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"But like a deaf man","kjv":"as a deaf"}},{"chapterId":"psa-58","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"that shuts","kjv":"they are like the deaf"}},{"chapterId":"isa-29","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"the deaf","kjv":"shall the deaf"}},{"chapterId":"isa-35","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"of the deaf","kjv":"of the deaf"}},{"chapterId":"isa-42","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"you deaf ones","kjv":"ye deaf"}},{"chapterId":"isa-42","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"or deaf","kjv":"or deaf"}},{"chapterId":"isa-43","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"but are deaf","kjv":"and the deaf"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Exodus 4:11","note":"Yahweh said to him, “Who made man’s mouth? Or who makes one mute, or deaf, or seeing, or blind? Isn’t it I, Yahweh?","source":"web"},{"ref":"Leviticus 19:14","note":"“ ‘You shall not curse the deaf, nor put a stumbling block before the blind; but you shall fear your God. I am Yahweh.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 38:13","note":"But I, as a deaf man, don’t hear. I am as a mute man who doesn’t open his mouth.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Isaiah 29:18","note":"In that day, the deaf will hear the words of the book, and the eyes of the blind will see out of obscurity and out of darkness.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}